// ─── Source filtering — mirror the main Dashboard live feed exactly.
// Leadership Updates should only contain what the dashboard surfaces, nothing
// extra. This drops feed-tracker noise (Vulners, OpenPhish, individual NVD
// CVE rows, GitHub Advisories listings, etc.) so the executive view stays
